# Don't track final .pptx or .pdf exports as a class (can be large)
*.pptx
*.pdf
# Keep this .gitignore tracked
!.gitignore
# Exception: appendix deliverables (committed alongside their build script
# for reproducibility and so reviewers can open them directly from the repo
# without re-running the builder). v1 preserved as historical artifact;
# v2 is the current deliverable (Phase 2 + 3 complete, 20 slides).
!aivc_appendix_v1.pptx
!aivc_appendix_v2.pptx
